  "originalText": "[Code Name] Steward\n[Gender] Male\n[Combat Experience] Half a year\n[Place of Birth] Kjerag\n[Date of Birth] December 24\n[Race] Vulpo\n[Height] 172cm\n[Infection Status] \nInfection confirmed by medical examination.",
